    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/b6e8ef6f2f079cbe72d0c7e80cf06c54.avif?t=1748537927\" data-has-big width=800 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPEED IS YOUR ONLY SURVIVAL</strong><br><br>You are M0M-3N7 \u2014 an experimental reconnaissance robot awakened decades after a disaster in a vast underground research complex. Designed to move constantly, your kinetic energy is the only thing keeping you alive. Stop \u2014 and your core collapses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate through malfunctioning test chambers, collapsed laboratories, and surreal, physics-defying zones near the Core. Use boosters, and precise timing to build momentum and survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more unstable the world becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the Q-STAR project, the collapse of the facility, and the origin of your consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of fast-paced, skill-heavy platformers with a strong sci-fi atmosphere like <i>Celeste</i>, <i>Dead Cells</i>, or <i>Katana Zero</i>, <strong>Momentum</strong> brings you heart-pounding movement, environmental storytelling, and a haunting descent into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/e061d031a19f2d01e6d49c42ff354f15.poster.avif?t=1748537927\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/e061d031a19f2d01e6d49c42ff354f15.webm?t=1748537927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/e061d031a19f2d01e6d49c42ff354f15.mp4?t=1748537927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/13aa0a98d61601f01b6f0dccdb0d93b3.poster.avif?t=1748537927\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/13aa0a98d61601f01b6f0dccdb0d93b3.webm?t=1748537927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/13aa0a98d61601f01b6f0dccdb0d93b3.mp4?t=1748537927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/ae488c3d63d40641d1033fd4459f6de1.poster.avif?t=1748537927\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/ae488c3d63d40641d1033fd4459f6de1.webm?t=1748537927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/ae488c3d63d40641d1033fd4459f6de1.mp4?t=1748537927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, </strong>momentum-driven platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement is survival </strong>\u2014<strong> </strong>stopping is death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric sci-fi world </strong>with environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-defying levels </strong>and<strong> </strong>kinetic challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/b6e8ef6f2f079cbe72d0c7e80cf06c54.avif?t=1748537927\" data-has-big width=800 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPEED IS YOUR ONLY SURVIVAL</strong><br><br>You are M0M-3N7 \u2014 an experimental reconnaissance robot awakened decades after a disaster in a vast underground research complex. Designed to move constantly, your kinetic energy is the only thing keeping you alive. Stop \u2014 and your core collapses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate through malfunctioning test chambers, collapsed laboratories, and surreal, physics-defying zones near the Core. Use boosters, and precise timing to build momentum and survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more unstable the world becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the Q-STAR project, the collapse of the facility, and the origin of your consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of fast-paced, skill-heavy platformers with a strong sci-fi atmosphere like <i>Celeste</i>, <i>Dead Cells</i>, or <i>Katana Zero</i>, <strong>Momentum</strong> brings you heart-pounding movement, environmental storytelling, and a haunting descent into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/e061d031a19f2d01e6d49c42ff354f15.poster.avif?t=1748537927\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/e061d031a19f2d01e6d49c42ff354f15.webm?t=1748537927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/e061d031a19f2d01e6d49c42ff354f15.mp4?t=1748537927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/13aa0a98d61601f01b6f0dccdb0d93b3.poster.avif?t=1748537927\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/13aa0a98d61601f01b6f0dccdb0d93b3.webm?t=1748537927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/13aa0a98d61601f01b6f0dccdb0d93b3.mp4?t=1748537927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/ae488c3d63d40641d1033fd4459f6de1.poster.avif?t=1748537927\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/ae488c3d63d40641d1033fd4459f6de1.webm?t=1748537927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656340/extras/ae488c3d63d40641d1033fd4459f6de1.mp4?t=1748537927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, </strong>momentum-driven platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement is survival </strong>\u2014<strong> </strong>stopping is death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric sci-fi world </strong>with environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-defying levels </strong>and<strong> </strong>kinetic challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
